docs/revision/followup2/runnerup_v2.py:5:runs under the label "C*" with the runner-up's credibility parameters, in its own output directory; its records differ
docs/revision/followup2/runnerup_v2.py:6:from the registered C* records by `rule_params_sha256`, and `label.json` names the rule. The driver refuses an output
docs/revision/followup2/runnerup_v2.py:11:Order: bank inputs (hash-checked against the original freeze), preflight, searches (D2+H3, then X7-SC), references,
