docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext.md:60:**The implementation and scoring agree with the written estimand and expectations. The claimed timing is internally consistent, but not independently proved by this archive.**
docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext.md:62:The original plan discloses the timing peek before expectations 1–4. The amendment discloses that the endpoint results were known before expectations 5–8 were written. It compares each search version with its own corresponding no-churn values, uses equal market weights, and keeps the reference candidate fixed while evaluating it under churn.
