docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext.md:219:A small inferential clarification would help. Run A applies the same materiality margin to nominal percentile intervals. Its direction label does not use the registered calibration and Holm procedure. This is disclosed in the plan and analysis file, but should be stated beside the paper’s quoted category. Source: `runs/drivers/common.py::q1_category`; `runs/runner-up-plan.md`, §3.
